      {
        "factor": "Proximity to threshold: 7,145,000 as of Feb 28, 2026 (7,143,993 articles)",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Only about 1,007 articles separate the threshold; if daily growth remains in the hundreds, crossing remains plausible."
